WEBVTT

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.016
There's one country that's taken
a much bigger step.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:06.796
Diana Barran: I am
the Minister of Loneliness.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:10.286
AG: "Minister of Loneliness."
Is that a job at Hogwarts?

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:14.276
DB: Well, some people think that
the Houses of Parliament are Hogwarts,

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:19.752
but no, I've had more correspondence
and more interest on this subject

00:12:19.776 --> 00:12:22.306
than anything else I'm responsible for.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.902
AG: Diana Barran is a
member of the House of Lords,

00:12:24.926 --> 00:12:27.046
which is a part of British Parliament.

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:31.096
Loneliness is a big problem
in the UK, even pre-Brexit.